{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2c6a06fa640aebe7","name":"The Ebon Hawk","source":{"id":"source:reference-2c6a06fa640aebe7","title":"The Ebon Hawk","revision":19358,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:48:16Z","sha256":"d713d7a1f7273ce8d479270bd20cb8e9581b8b9e9eb634140c23131ca9e7881b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19358","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Ebon%20Hawk&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2c6a06fa640aebe7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ebon Hawk"]}," is the prized possession of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"}," Exchange boss ",{"tag":"a","children":["Davik Kang"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Davik_Kang?action=edit&redlink=1"},"- at least until an amnesic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," takes it away from him. The vessel's history is almost completely unknown, but over the years the ship's owners (many of whom have been members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Exchange"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Exchange","referenceId":"reference:5b7f5a0f628062b7"},") have upgraded, modified, and otherwise personalized the ship to suit their needs. The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ebon Hawk"]}," is recognizable in many spaceports, and on fringe worlds throughout the galaxy, sometimes a welcome sight, and sometimes a herald of trouble.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ebon Hawk"]}," boasts improved hull integrity, advanced weapons, heavily modified engines, and one of the fastest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," available. Moreover, the ship's weapon's load has been improved significantly over the stock ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Dynamic"]},"-Class Freighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dynamic-Class_Freighter","referenceId":"reference:b676957ae7a03a42"},", and a shield generator more powerful than those found on most military ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},". Though the ship has been associated with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Exchange"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Exchange","referenceId":"reference:5b7f5a0f628062b7"}," for most of its existence, The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ebon Hawk"]}," might find its way into the hands of heroes any time in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic_Era"},", and the heroes have a chance to make their mark on this iconic freighter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ebon Hawk"]}," Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal* ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -1; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["*This ship is treated as a Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," for the purposes of being targeted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.mir